Package: xfce-removable-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xfce4-panel, udisks2
Recommends: gvfs-backends
Description: Xfce panel plugin for removable drives, phones and USB devices
 Lists removable drives grouped by disk, with mount, unmount and safe
 removal; Android phones (MTP), cameras (PTP) and iPhones through gvfs;
 and other connected USB devices such as gamepads, graphics tablets,
 security keys, serial boards, printers, audio and MIDI devices.
 .
 Works on X11 and on Wayland (Xfce 4.20). Independent project, not
 affiliated with the Xfce project.
